Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Those three QR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:03.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,squares\Naren't decoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:03.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,They tell the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:05.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,scanner\Nwhere to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.45,0:00:07.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Denso Wave released
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:08.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,the QR Code
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:08.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,in {\c&H45ADF2&}1994,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:09.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,and QR means
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:11.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,quick response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,The corner marks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:14.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,are position\Ndetection patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:15.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Finding them made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,high-speed\Nreading possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why squares?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:19.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,The team said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:20.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,that pattern was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.15,0:00:21.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,least likely to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:22.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,appear\Non business forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,They\Nsurveyed flyers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:25.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,magazines\Nand cardboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:26.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,boxes for the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.53,0:00:28.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,rarest black-and-white ratio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:29.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,That rare ratio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,lets a scanner
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:31.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,orient the code
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,from any angle.
